!!! Reached AArch64 assembly: native routes reverse the bytes of 1;
!!! interpreted routes must reject the retained INLINE_ASM opcode.
book tour.asm-called-aarch64

swap-bytes receives word as number returns number begin paragraph
    variable result as number is 0
    assembly for aarch64 is "mov $0, $1; rev $0, $0" using word giving result
    give result
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph
    say swap-bytes with word being 1
    give 0
end paragraph
